# AI in Healthcare & Machine Learning — Project Portfolio

A chronological set of hands-on projects completed during a 6-week AI in Healthcare & Drug Discovery bootcamp (BiotechTrek), building from core Python through supervised/unsupervised ML, genomics, cheminformatics, and medical imaging. Built on a BSc Medical Laboratory Science background, as part of preparation for PhD study in Biomedical Informatics.

